    {
      "text": "Wan Xiang’s will in treasure yellow heaven offers it as the third of three star path killer moves, priced at one immortal essence stone. Activation needs small numbers of spiral bone spear Gu, several star river Gu, countless star dart Gu, and large numbers of shooting star Gu.",
