      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan has not heard of it and remembers no standout use of it in his previous life’s five regions war, so he treats it as out of use with many weaknesses and plans an offensive buy around icy stardust instead. He does not purchase spiral drill star spear.",
